#: ../../tools/github_tools.rst:32 a593cb4a1b02412c8bf9d2b48077d433
msgid ""
"**Description**: Get detailed metadata for a specific GitHub public "
"repository. Returns full repository information including description, "
"statistics (stars, forks, watchers, open issues), programming language, "
"topics, license, README existence, and recent activity. Use full\\_name "
"in owner/repo format (e.g., 'deepmind/alphafold'). Useful for getting "
"repository details for scientific software tools."
msgstr ""

